       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-MYDORGE-TOT.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-MYDORGE-TOT-PROOFS.
           05  WS-TRANSVERSAL-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTIENT-CYCLE-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-FOCAL-REFLECT-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MYDORGE-LATENCY-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MYDORGE-SEAL-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-MYDORGE-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PMY-PROVEN           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-PMY-CODE           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-TRANSVERSAL-AND-TOTIENT.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-FOCAL-AND-LATENCY.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-PMY-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-TRANSVERSAL-AND-TOTIENT.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TRANSVERSAL-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTIENT-CYCLE-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-FOCAL-AND-LATENCY.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-FOCAL-REFLECT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MYDORGE-LATENCY-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-PMY-PROOFS.
           IF WS-TRANSVERSAL-OK = 1 AND
              WS-TOTIENT-CYCLE-OK = 1 AND
              WS-FOCAL-REFLECT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-MYDORGE-LATENCY-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-MYDORGE-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PMY-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-PMY-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-PMY-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-PMY-CODE.
